Homepage: https://github.com/jalexlong/paperweight-os
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: paperweight-plymouth
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, plymouth, plymouth-label
Description: PaperweightOS Plymouth theme — all four Catppuccin variants
 Installs a Catppuccin-themed Plymouth boot splash for PaperweightOS.
 Ships all four variants (Macchiato, Latte, Frappé, Mocha). Defaults to
 Macchiato on install. Uses the script plugin: solid base background with
 a fixed wordmark and three-dot sequencing animation.
 .
 Switch variants with: sudo paperweight-plymouth-theme <variant>
 .
 Sets the Plymouth default theme and rebuilds the initramfs on install and
 removal. On eMMC storage this may take 30-60 seconds.
